*> vybe-test: cobol/arrays_tables_indexing/occurs_depending_compiles
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_arrays_tables_indexing.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 CNT PIC 9 VALUE 2.
01 TBL PIC X(2) OCCURS 1 TO 5 TIMES DEPENDING ON CNT.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE 2 TO CNT.
    MOVE "AA" TO TBL(1).
    MOVE "BB" TO TBL(2).
    DISPLAY TBL(1).
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING TBL(1) DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "AA"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [AA] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    DISPLAY TBL(2).
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING TBL(2) DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "BB"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [BB] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

